<title>USA: TransAmerica Finance sets $200 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>TransAmerica Finance sets $200 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from TransAmerica Finance was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER TRANSAMERICA FINANCE</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 6.375 PCT  MATURITY 11/15/2001</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    YIELD 6.375 PCT   PAY FREQ	 N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS    SPREAD 41 BP	CALLABLE	 NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
